{"id":"torrey:parents","source":"torrey","name":"Parents","slug":"parents","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Receive their children from God — Ge 33:5; 1Sa 1:27; Ps 127:3.","refs":[["Gen",33,5,33,5],["1Sam",1,27,1,27],["Ps",127,3,127,3]]},{"text":"To love them. — Tit 2:4.","refs":[["Titus",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"To bring them to Christ. — Mt 19:13,14.","refs":[["Matt",19,13,19,13],["Matt",19,14,19,14]]},{"text":"To train them up for God. — Pr 22:6; Eph 6:4.","refs":[["Prov",22,6,22,6],["Eph",6,4,6,4]]},{"text":"To instruct them in God’s word. — De 4:9; 11:19; Isa 38:19.","refs":[["Deut",4,9,4,9],["Deut",11,19,11,19],["Isa",38,19,38,19]]},{"text":"To tell them of God’s judgments. — Joe 1:3.","refs":[["Joel",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"To tell them of the miraculous works of God. — Ex 10:2; Ps 78:4.","refs":[["Exod",10,2,10,2],["Ps",78,4,78,4]]},{"text":"To command them to obey God. — De 32:46; 1Ch 28:9.","refs":[["Deut",32,46,32,46],["1Chr",28,9,28,9]]},{"text":"To bless them. — Ge 48:15; Heb 11:20.","refs":[["Gen",48,15,48,15],["Heb",11,20,11,20]]},{"text":"To pity them. — Ps 103:13.","refs":[["Ps",103,13,103,13]]},{"text":"To provide for them. — Job 42:15; 2Co 12:14; 1Ti 5:8.","refs":[["Job",42,15,42,15],["2Cor",12,14,12,14],["1Tim",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"To rule them. — 1Ti 3:4,12.","refs":[["1Tim",3,4,3,4],["1Tim",3,12,3,12]]},{"text":"To correct them. — Pr 13:24; 19:18; 23:13; 29:17; Heb 12:7.","refs":[["Prov",13,24,13,24],["Prov",19,18,19,18],["Prov",23,13,23,13],["Prov",29,17,29,17],["Heb",12,7,12,7]]},{"text":"Not to provoke them. — Eph 6:4; Col 3:21.","refs":[["Eph",6,4,6,4],["Col",3,21,3,21]]},{"text":"Not to make unholy connections for them. — Ge 24:1-4; 28:1,2.","refs":[["Gen",24,1,24,4],["Gen",28,1,28,1],["Gen",28,2,28,2]]},{"text":"Wicked children, a cause of grief to — Pr 10:1; 17:25.","refs":[["Prov",10,1,10,1],["Prov",17,25,17,25]]},{"text":"For their spiritual welfare. — Ge 17:18; 1Ch 29:19.","refs":[["Gen",17,18,17,18],["1Chr",29,19,29,19]]},{"text":"When in temptation. — Job 1:5.","refs":[["Job",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"When in sickness. — 2Sa 12:16; Mr 5:23; Joh 4:46,49.","refs":[["2Sam",12,16,12,16],["Mark",5,23,5,23],["John",4,46,4,46],["John",4,49,4,49]]},{"text":"Are blessed by their children. — Pr 31:28.","refs":[["Prov",31,28,31,28]]},{"text":"Leave a blessing to their children. — Ps 112:2; Pr 11:21; Isa 65:23.","refs":[["Ps",112,2,112,2],["Prov",11,21,11,21],["Isa",65,23,65,23]]},{"text":"Sins of, visited on their children — Ex 20:5; Isa 14:20; La 5:7.","refs":[["Exod",20,5,20,5],["Isa",14,20,14,20],["Lam",5,7,5,7]]},{"text":"Negligence of, sorely punished — 1Sa 3:13.","refs":[["1Sam",3,13,3,13]]},{"text":"Instruct their children in evil. — Jer 9:14; 1Pe 1:18.","refs":[["Jer",9,14,9,14],["1Pet",1,18,1,18]]},{"text":"Set a bad example to their children. — Eze 20:18; Am 2:4.","refs":[["Ezek",20,18,20,18],["Amos",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Abraham. — Ge 18:19.","refs":[["Gen",18,19,18,19]]},{"text":"Jacob. — Ge 44:20,30.","refs":[["Gen",44,20,44,20],["Gen",44,30,44,30]]},{"text":"Joseph. — Ge 48:13-20.","refs":[["Gen",48,13,48,20]]},{"text":"Mother of Moses. — Ex 2:2,3.","refs":[["Exod",2,2,2,2],["Exod",2,3,2,3]]},{"text":"Manoah. — Jdj 13:8.","refs":[["Judg",13,8,13,8]]},{"text":"Hannah. — 1Sa 1:28.","refs":[["1Sam",1,28,1,28]]},{"text":"David. — 2Sa 18:5,33.","refs":[["2Sam",18,5,18,5],["2Sam",18,33,18,33]]},{"text":"Shunammite. — 2Ki 4:19,20.","refs":[["2Kgs",4,19,4,19],["2Kgs",4,20,4,20]]},{"text":"Job. — Job 1:5.","refs":[["Job",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Mother of Lemuel. — Pr 31:1.","refs":[["Prov",31,1,31,1]]},{"text":"Nobleman. — Joh 4:49.","refs":[["John",4,49,4,49]]},{"text":"Lois and Eunice. — 2Ti 1:5.","refs":[["2Tim",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Mother of Micah. — Jdj 17:3.","refs":[["Judg",17,3,17,3]]},{"text":"Eli. — 1Sa 3:13.","refs":[["1Sam",3,13,3,13]]},{"text":"Saul. — 1Sa 20:33.","refs":[["1Sam",20,33,20,33]]},{"text":"Athaliah. — 2Ch 22:3.","refs":[["2Chr",22,3,22,3]]},{"text":"Manasseh. — 2Ch 33:6.","refs":[["2Chr",33,6,33